# crypto-sha. Adapted from EYE reasoning examples (MIT, Jos De Roo).
# Source: https://eyereasoner.github.io/eye/reasoning/crypto/cryptoP.n3
# SHA-1 only; other hash relations from the source are not implemented.

@prefix : <http://example.org/>.
@prefix math: <http://www.w3.org/2000/10/swap/math#>.
@prefix list: <http://www.w3.org/2000/10/swap/list#>.
@prefix log: <http://www.w3.org/2000/10/swap/log#>.
@prefix crypto: <http://www.w3.org/2000/10/swap/crypto#>.
{ ("" "abc" "blargh") list:member ?Text. ?Text crypto:sha ?Digest }
    => { :hashes :sha1 (?Text ?Digest) }.
